cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the frozen pipelines, please cite the article listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "Frozen LLM-Generated Preprocessing for Medical-Claims Adherence Classification: code, frozen pipelines, and results"
abstract: >-
  Notebooks, frozen LLM-generated preprocessing code (DeepSeek, Claude Sonnet 4.6,
  GPT-5.4, CAAFE), verbatim model responses, and result files supporting a
  leakage-controlled comparison of frozen LLM-generated preprocessing against a
  predefined Manual Expert workflow for medication-adherence classification on
  the Cimas medical-claims dataset (Mendeley Data, CC0 1.0).
